/**
 * @mainpage R-TYPE Documentation
 *
 * @section intro_sec Introduction
 *
 * Welcome to the documentation for R-TYPE. This document provides an
 * overview of the project, its architecture, and how to use its various
 * components.
 *
 * @subsection infos_sub What is our R-TYPE
 *
 * R-TYPE is an arcade multiplayer game. The gameplay is a one of a space
 * shooter, with at least two players going through waves of ennemies.
 * The game runs on an ECS game engine, and the server-client communication
 * is made possible by a binary UDP protocol.
 *
 * @subsection parts_sub Parts of the project
 *
 * Key parts of R-TYPE include:
 * - Part 1: The game engine.
 * - Part 2: The server.
 * - Part 3: The client.
 *
 *
 * @section contact_sec Contact Information
 *
 * For questions or support, please contact Farouk OKANLA, farouk@epitech.eu.
 *
 * @note This documentation is continuously updated.
 */
